#: ../installation/other_methods.rst:5
msgid "Other installation methods"
msgstr ""

#: ../installation/other_methods.rst:7
msgid "Instead of installing Galette from the archive, you can use one of the packages listed below. They are maintained by the community, outside of the Galette release process: a package may be published some time after a new Galette release, and its installation and update procedures are those of the package. Refer to its own documentation, and report packaging issues to its repository."
msgstr ""

#: ../installation/other_methods.rst:9
msgid "Whatever the method, keep regular backups of your database and of Galette data directories."
msgstr ""

#: ../installation/other_methods.rst:12
msgid "Docker"
msgstr ""

#: ../installation/other_methods.rst:14
msgid "The `Galette Docker image <https://hub.docker.com/r/galette/galette>`_ is built from the `galette/docker repository <https://github.com/galette/docker>`_. It embeds Galette with a selection of official plugins."
msgstr ""

#: ../installation/other_methods.rst:16
msgid "The image does not include a database server: you have to run MariaDB, MySQL or PostgreSQL separately, for example in another container. Configuration and data files are stored on volumes, so they are kept when you upgrade to a newer image."
msgstr ""

#: ../installation/other_methods.rst:19
msgid "YunoHost"
msgstr ""

#: ../installation/other_methods.rst:21
msgid "`YunoHost <https://yunohost.org>`_ is a server operating system designed to make self-hosting easy. Galette is available in its `application catalog <https://apps.yunohost.org/app/galette>`_; the package sources are in the `galette_ynh repository <https://github.com/YunoHost-Apps/galette_ynh>`_."
msgstr ""

#: ../installation/other_methods.rst:23
msgid "YunoHost takes care of the web server, the database and the updates. Check the packaged Galette version in the catalog before installing: it may not be the latest release yet."
msgstr ""

#: ../installation/other_methods.rst:26
msgid "Hosted instances"
msgstr ""

#: ../installation/other_methods.rst:28
msgid "If you do not want to install Galette yourself, some hosting providers offer Galette instances to non-profit organizations. The `CHATONS <https://www.chatons.org>`_ collective (mostly French-speaking alternative hosting providers committed to free software, transparency and data protection) lists its members offering Galette in its `service directory <https://www.chatons.org/search/by-service?field_software_target_id=311>`_."
msgstr ""

#: ../installation/other_methods.rst:30
msgid "These providers run their own instances: the Galette version, the available plugins and the support are under their responsibility. Before choosing one, ask how you can retrieve your data if you leave."
msgstr ""
